# A register pointing at a file this tree lacks

`set aside` is a rule read to its end and accepted as it stands.

## cs/example-first, set aside

One search this tree answers:

```
git grep -n 'Code-scanning rules' -- docs/code-scanning-dispositions.md
```

and one it cannot, because the page it names was renamed and nothing said so:

```
git grep -n 'the reason that used to be here' -- docs/a-page-this-tree-does-not-have.md
```
